SkylakeX/Cooperlake/Sapphire Rapids CGEMM/ZGEMM: compute the m-edge blocks with the same
per-lane instruction sequence (separate real/imaginary accumulators combined at store) as the
widest m block, instead of a fused fmaddsub chain that rounds differently.  Fixes position-
dependent results that broke the LAPACK CGEEV/ZGEEV/CGGEV/ZGGEV(3) exact-equality checks.
